---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CallToAction from '../components/CallToAction.astro';
import joyImage from '../assets/people/joy-one-to-one.jpg';
import { organizationSchema, serviceSchema } from '../data/schema';
---
<BaseLayout title="One-to-One Life & Leadership Coaching | Threads Coaching" description="One-to-one coaching for clearer, more courageous next steps in life, leadership, purpose and change." path="/one-to-one-sessions" schema={[organizationSchema, serviceSchema('One-to-one life and leadership coaching', '/one-to-one-sessions', 'One-to-one coaching for clearer, more courageous next steps in life, leadership, purpose and change.')] }>
  <div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'One-to-one coaching' }]} /></div>
  <section class="hero-copy section"><div class="container split split--media"><div><p class="eyebrow">One-to-one coaching</p><h1>One-to-one coaching for clearer, more courageous next steps.</h1><p class="lead">When a decision, calling, leadership challenge or long-held pattern needs more than a quick answer, coaching gives you room to think it through well.</p><a class="button" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a></div><Image src={joyImage} alt="Joy in conversation" width={640} densities={[1, 1.5]} sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 45vw, 100vw" quality={60} /></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Move from carrying the question to taking a next step.</h2><p>Coaching can help when you want to lead with more confidence, clarify your purpose, discern a calling, strengthen habits, navigate relationships or live in closer alignment with your values.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><h2>What you might explore</h2><div class="three-up"><p><strong>Purpose and direction</strong><br />Clarifying what matters and where to focus your energy.</p><p><strong>Leadership and confidence</strong><br />Working through obstacles, uncertainty and unhelpful patterns.</p><p><strong>Values and faith</strong><br />Connecting practical choices with what you believe and hope for.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><h2>A thoughtful, practical process</h2><ol class="steps"><li><strong>Begin with your situation.</strong><span>Name the change, decision or question in front of you.</span></li><li><strong>Explore what matters.</strong><span>Notice patterns, values, possibilities and obstacles.</span></li><li><strong>Choose your next step.</strong><span>Leave with a clearer, realistic direction.</span></li></ol><p>Joy and Paul bring different experience. Read more <a href="/about">about their approaches</a>, or start a conversation if you would like help choosing the right fit.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Related support</h2><p>Want to understand your natural patterns in more depth? <a href="/personality-discover-develop">Explore personality coaching</a>. Looking for whole-person, faith-aware reflection? <a href="/body-soul-spirit-reset">Explore Body Soul Spirit Reset</a>.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Questions people often ask</h2><details><summary>Do I need to know exactly what I want from coaching?</summary><p>No. The first conversation can help you name the question or change that feels most important.</p></details><details><summary>Is coaching the same as counselling?</summary><p>No. Coaching is a reflective, forward-looking conversation and is not a replacement for clinical, medical or therapeutic support.</p></details></div></section>
  <CallToAction title="A clearer next step can begin with a conversation." body="You do not need to know exactly what you need before getting in touch." primaryHref="/contact" primaryLabel="Start a conversation" />
</BaseLayout>
